            },
            "body": "Hi @taneem-ibrahim @noooop — this is a small Counter.reset() bugfix (docs/tests not involved in the logic change). pre-run-check is blocking full CI for me as a new contributor.\n\nWould one of you mind commenting `/ci run` when you have a moment (same as you kindly did on #64170)? Happy to address any review feedback. Thanks!",
